  So I pushed it over to the stairs and... There it sat.

  Hmmm...

  I tried again several times. Even seeing if it would work from
different angles of approach. No show.

  Darn. Oh well. That didn't work (sad face)...

  We went down to the Titans level.


  I turned auto pick up off again. Water you know...

  Levitated to the island where the werewolf had fooled me (wink). 

  I only needed one boulder, so took quite a lot of time to:
Contemplate where I would be placing the eight extra ones...

  Pulled the chin strap tight on my helmet, and rumbled down nine
