fortress. So I've used two. Besides that - never. But I've lost
potions many times, like when the pyrolisk micro waved me, and other
accidents. I think it shows how careful I've been throughout the game.


   Made it back to base camp level 24. Good. Imagine if I would have
died to something on the way back here from the Titan's level (wink).

  Okay... (rub hands together) What to start with? 

  Hmmm...

